      "<div id=\"Wiki_Details\">\n",
      "<div class=\"wikiRenderedText renderedText originalText\" id=\"wikiRenderedText\" itemprop=\"text\">\n",
      "<div class=\"clearer\"></div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section__Background\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"Link to this section\"><span class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 640 512\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135.6 0c-35.7-35.7-37.6-92.9-4.4-130.9l4.7-5.4c8.7-10 7.7-25.1-2.3-33.9s-25.1-7.7-33.9 2.3l-4.7 5.4c-49.8 57-46.9 142.9 6.6 196.4c56.2 56.2 147.3 56.2 203.5 0L580.3 267.2zM59.7 244.8C3.5 301 3.5 392.1 59.7 448.2c53.6 53.6 139.5 56.4 196.5 6.5l6.1-5.4c10-8.7 11-23.9 2.3-33.9s-23.9-11-33.9-2.3l-6.1 5.4c-38 33.2-95.2 31.3-130.9-4.4c-37.4-37.4-37.4-98.1 0-135.6L207 165.4c37.4-37.4 98.1-37.4 135.6 0c35.7 35.7 37.6 92.9 4.4 130.9l-5.4 6.1c-8.7 10-7.7 25.1 2.3 33.9s25.1 7.7 33.9-2.3l5.4-6.1c49.9-57 47-142.9-6.5-196.5c-56.2-56.2-147.3-56.2-203.5 0L59.7 244.8z\"></path></svg></span></a><h2 class=\"header\" id=\"Section__Background\"><strong>Background</strong></h2></div>\n",
      "<p>The Acer Aspire 1 A114-31 was released in 2018. It features an Intel Celeron processor, 4GB of RAM, and eMMC storage. The device was aimed  at students, home users, and individuals looking for a laptop for basic computing tasks such as web browsing and document editing.</p>\n",
      "<p>It was discontinued in 2021, with newer models taking its place in Acer's product lineup. During its lifespan, the device typically sold for around $200 to $300 at launch, depending on the configuration. As for units sold, the Aspire 1 series overall sold millions of units worldwide, with the A114-31 being one of the more popular models in this segment.</p>\n",
      "<p>Despite the positive feedback on the device’s affordability and battery life, some widespread complaints in consumer reviews pointed to the limited storage and the performance limitations of the Intel Celeron processor, especially when running more demanding applications. Some users also reported occasional issues with the eMMC storage slowing down after prolonged use.</p>\n",
      "<p>The Aspire 1 A114-31 was positioned as an entry-level device within Acer’s Aspire lineup, replacing older budget models that offered similar features but with slightly less performance. After the A114-31, Acer released the Aspire 1 A114-32, which came with slightly improved specs, including faster processors, better storage options, and a slightly refined design.</p>\n",
      "<p><strong>Sources:</strong></p>\n",
      "<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgets360.com/acer-aspire-one-a114-31-c4hh-7010#:~:text=Acer%20Aspire%20One%20A114%2D31%2DC4HH%20is%20a%20Windows%2010,by%20Intel%20Integrated%20HD%20Graphics.\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Acer Aspire One A114-31 Summary</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.acer.com/gb-en/laptops/aspire/aspire-1/pdp/NX.GVZEK.007\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Acer Aspire 1 A114-32 Technical Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"https://laptopmedia.com/ca/review/acer-aspire-1-a114-32-review-an-ultra-budget-laptop-for-media-consumption/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Acer Aspire 1 (A114-32) review on Laptopmedia</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cnet.com/reviews/acer-aspire-1-2020-review/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Acer Aspire 1 A114-31 review on cnet.com</a></li></ul>\n",
      "<div class=\"clearer\"></div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section__Identification\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"Link to this section\"><span class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 640 512\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135.6 0c-35.7-35.7-37.6-92.9-4.4-130.9l4.7-5.4c8.7-10 7.7-25.1-2.3-33.9s-25.1-7.7-33.9 2.3l-4.7 5.4c-49.8 57-46.9 142.9 6.6 196.4c56.2 56.2 147.3 56.2 203.5 0L580.3 267.2zM59.7 244.8C3.5 301 3.5 392.1 59.7 448.2c53.6 53.6 139.5 56.4 196.5 6.5l6.1-5.4c10-8.7 11-23.9 2.3-33.9s-23.9-11-33.9-2.3l-6.1 5.4c-38 33.2-95.2 31.3-130.9-4.4c-37.4-37.4-37.4-98.1 0-135.6L207 165.4c37.4-37.4 98.1-37.4 135.6 0c35.7 35.7 37.6 92.9 4.4 130.9l-5.4 6.1c-8.7 10-7.7 25.1 2.3 33.9s25.1 7.7 33.9-2.3l5.4-6.1c49.9-57 47-142.9-6.5-196.5c-56.2-56.2-147.3-56.2-203.5 0L59.7 244.8z\"></path></svg></span></a><h2 class=\"header\" id=\"Section__Identification\"><strong>Identification</strong></h2></div>\n",
      "<p>The Acer Aspire 1 A114-31 features a simple, lightweight design with a 14-inch display and a plastic body. It measures about 13.3 inches wide, 9.1 inches deep, and 0.8 inches high, weighing around 3.3 pounds. The model number, A114-31, is located on the bottom panel, typically near the center, alongside product stickers.</p>\n",
      "<p>This laptop is usually available in silver or gray, with no distinctive markings or design features. It has a standard full-size keyboard and basic touchpad, distinguishing it from higher-end models in the Aspire lineup. The Acer logo is located on the top lid, helping users identify the brand. The A114-31's compact size and entry-level features make it easy to differentiate from other models.</p>\n",
      "<p><strong>Sources:</strong></p>\n",
      "<ul><li><a href=\"https://icecat.biz/en-ca/p/acer/nx.shxsa.002/aspire-notebooks-a114-31-c67w-38065262.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Acer Aspire 1 A114-31 Icecat.co.uk</a></li></ul>\n",
