      "<ul><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron N3350 (2.4 GHz burst frequency, dual-core)</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 500</li><li><strong>RAM:</strong> 4GB DDR4</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB eMMC or 128GB eMMC (depending on configuration)</li><li><strong>Display:</strong> 14-inch HD (1366 x 768) LED-backlit</li><li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Windows 10 Home in S Mode (upgradable to Windows 10 Home)</li><li><strong>Ports:</strong><ul><li>2 x USB 3.0 ports</li><li>1 x USB 2.0 port</li><li>1 x HDMI port</li><li>1 x Ethernet (RJ-45) port</li><li>1 x Headphone/speaker jack</li><li>1 x MicroSD card reader</li></ul></li><li><strong>Battery:</strong> 2-cell Li-ion, 7.6V 4810mAh, up to 8 hours of battery life</li><li><strong>Webcam:</strong> 720p HD camera</li><li><strong>Audio:</strong> 2 x stereo speakers, built-in microphone</li><li><strong>Wi-Fi:</strong> 802.11ac Wi-Fi</li><li><strong>Bluetooth:</strong> Bluetooth 4.0</li><li><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Standard full-size keyboard</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 13.3\" x 9.1\" x 0.8\" (338mm x 231mm x 20.1mm)</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> Approximately 3.3 lbs (1.5 kg)</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Typically silver or gray (may vary by region)</li></ul>\n",
